00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:13.440
or clothing for themselves.

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:15.793
So again, it only has to
be one of these three.

00:06:16.902 --> 00:06:20.230
And so essentially by shelter,

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:22.820
the person doesn't have
a safe place to live.

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:27.820
