for a long period of time,

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:39.457
so bacteria buildup
can also cause a health

00:06:39.457 --> 00:06:41.360
risk to that person,

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:43.530
or that the person
takes off their clothing

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:45.460
