00:07:08.708 --> 00:07:12.248
And, and, and the only
way that you can get it,

00:07:12.248 --> 00:07:16.660
an LPS conservatorship put through,

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:18.860
is if the person is in holding.

00:07:18.860 --> 00:07:20.690
And so the person must be in holding

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:24.290
