00:07:28.570 --> 00:07:31.127
You can call for a 51 50,

00:07:31.127 --> 00:07:35.360
and then that person would
be put on a 72 hour hold

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:37.340
for a suicide watch.

00:07:37.340 --> 00:07:38.363
And in that timeframe,

00:07:38.363 --> 00:07:42.206
