already put together,

00:07:42.206 --> 00:07:45.921
you have to act very
quickly, in only three days.

00:07:45.921 --> 00:07:50.653
You can work with the,
with the patient's doctor.

00:07:51.875 --> 00:07:53.820
And then of course, for the jail factor,

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:56.889
if someone is attacking
you or trying to hurt you,

00:07:56.889 --> 00:08:00.000
you can call 911, and they
would be taken to a jail.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.700
But at the same time, because
they have a mental illness,

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:04.640
they have certain medications
