00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:06.570
there's a doctor that's involved.

00:08:06.570 --> 00:08:10.460
And so when you have that
paperwork ready to go,

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:12.410
you would contact the person's defender,

00:08:12.410 --> 00:08:16.920
and you would also contact
the doctor of, of the patient.

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:19.610
And so by working with
the healthcare provider,

00:08:19.610 --> 00:08:23.083
having the document already
filled out and ready to go,

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:26.570
you can have that, that doctor,

00:08:26.570 --> 00:08:28.480
it's only a one-page document

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:31.930
because it needs to be proven very simply.

00:08:31.930 --> 00:08:35.280
But by having that page
filled out, ready to go,

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:38.420
if the doctor recommends that the,

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:40.550
the conservatorship goes through,

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:43.160
then you have one year of treatment

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:45.460
that you can actually
force on the patient.

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:49.631
And it's really important
for people to understand

00:08:49.631 --> 00:08:54.470
that getting raped on
Skid Row, being homeless,

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:57.873
having a random person
inject heroin into your arm,

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:02.250
you know, having a threat of disease,

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:04.230
to anyone else that would be rock bottom

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:07.420
and that would be an
opportunity to completely

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:10.500
change your life and say, I
want to do something different.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:12.170
This is not my life.

00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:16.490
To someone that has been in severe trauma

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:19.200
and has become disabled by their traumas,

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:21.220
just completely crippled,

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:24.860
that, this isn't, this,
the ability for them

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:26.120
to do whatever they want,

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:27.910
which is essentially to kill themselves,

00:09:27.910 --> 00:09:31.210
be self-destructive, is
not a rock bottom for them.

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:33.660
So they'll continue to
do it until they die.

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:38.660
And what is rock bottom is
that taking away that control.

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:44.770
So what we're working on is
having two options for Amanda.

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:47.460
One, the LPS conservatorship goes through.

00:09:47.460 --> 00:09:51.029
She's going to have either
an actual treatment center,

00:09:51.029 --> 00:09:53.260
where they're going to work with her.

00:09:53.260 --> 00:09:55.380
They're going to provide care.

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:57.150
They're going to do the therapies,

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:59.880
and she's gonna, she's
gonna have that for a year.

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:02.200
If she leaves, if she walks out,

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:04.800
her only other option is
a psychiatric hospital.

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:07.010
And basically, they sedate you,

00:10:07.010 --> 00:10:08.870
they give you medications,

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.510
