TV and walk in circles.

00:10:13.845 --> 00:10:17.760
So you're either going to
be held in a psych ward,

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:20.670
or you're going to be, you know,
given the opportunity to go

00:10:20.670 --> 00:10:22.560
to a beautiful treatment center,

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:24.370
where you have a team of
people working with you

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:25.650
to help you get better.

00:10:25.650 --> 00:10:28.190
And if you choose to leave
again, back to the psych ward.

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:29.733
And it's just going to be a ping pong

00:10:29.733 --> 00:10:32.220
between psych ward and treatment,

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:33.053
and psych ward and treatment.

00:10:33.053 --> 00:10:33.930
